@startuml job-lifecycle
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
hide empty description
title Minimal Job Lifecycle\nJob state and stage-task state are separate
state "ACCEPTED\nCompleted dataset + frozen config\nAtomic job and PREPARE task" as Accepted
state "PREPARE / CPU\nValidate / exact dedup / near-duplicate groups\nFreeze approximately 90/10 split" as Prepare
state "CAPTION / optional\nProvided text > template or BLIP\nFreeze final training-input manifest" as Caption
state "TRAIN\nLoRA parameters only\nFull resumable checkpoints" as Train #F3E8FF
state "EVALUATE\nReload saved adapter and generate\nCLIP diagnostics + paired A/B" as Evaluate #F3E8FF
state "PUBLISH / CPU\nCheck exact input, adapter and report hashes\nAtomic registry + terminal job state" as Publish #DCFCE7
state "READY\nCalibrated policy passed\nOwner-authorized download" as Ready #DCFCE7
state "COMPLETED_UNVERIFIED\nModel: UNVERIFIED\nExplicit allow_unverified download" as Unverified #FEF3C7
state "QUALITY_REJECTED\nCalibrated policy failed\nReport retained; no automatic retraining" as Rejected #FEE2E2
state "FAILED\nData / configuration / OOM / technical error" as Failed #FEE2E2

[*] --> Accepted
Accepted --> Prepare
Prepare --> Caption : Missing captions
Prepare --> Train : Captions already complete\nFinalize input manifest
Prepare --> Failed : Too small / unsuitable / invalid
Caption --> Train
Train --> Evaluate : Complete saved adapter
Evaluate --> Publish : Technical pass; policy PASS or uncalibrated
Evaluate --> Rejected : Calibrated policy FAIL
Evaluate --> Failed : Load / generation / metric execution failure
Publish --> Ready : Calibrated PASS; not test-only
Publish --> Unverified : Uncalibrated or test-only
Ready --> [*]
Unverified --> [*]

legend bottom left
  GPU stages reacquire a shared physical device; no permanent evaluation GPU.
  Infrastructure failures: at most three attempts; restore compatible complete checkpoint.
  OOM and quality failure do not silently alter training parameters.
  CANCEL_REQUESTED becomes CANCELLED only after executor termination is confirmed.
  Stale attempts cannot commit outputs or publish; test-only artifacts cannot become READY.
endlegend
@enduml
